/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The Freedom in Africa Report \(FinAR\) is an initiative of the Liberalist Centre, a policy and research think tank dedicated to advancing liberty and prosperity across the African continent.)
/E (The Freedom in Africa Report \(FinAR\) is an initiative of the Liberalist Centre, a policy and research think tank dedicated to advancing liberty and prosperity across the African continent.)
/Pg 9 0 R
